        "summary": "request is officially deprecated and has had no releases or commits in roughly seven years, yet it still pulls ~15.3M weekly downloads — a legacy footprint, not an active project. With a known SSRF vulnerability affecting the latest version and no maintainer to patch it, new code should not depend on it.",
