          "The latest version ships a moderate-severity SSRF vulnerability (GHSA-p8p7-x288-28g6), and since the project is abandoned there will be no patched release to move to.",
          "Development is fully stalled on GitHub too: the repo (25,492 stars) has had no commits in ~2,430 days, so bugs and security reports go unaddressed.",
          "The ~15.3M weekly downloads show the package is still widely installed, but that reflects legacy code that hasn't migrated — it doesn't indicate active maintenance, and the tension is worth acknowledging while still steering new work away.",
          "It also ships no TypeScript type information, so modern TS projects would need @types/request anyway — another sign the package predates current ecosystem expectations."
